  (3,3,3)r1 Q=8 th=1; (3,2,3)r1 Q=7 th=2.
On every TOP component the generic rank of J equals Q = delta + C_sh.

THE RANK-SPLIT CLAIM TO AUDIT (conjectured general, proved per-case):
  rank J(A) = delta + dim I(Abar),   where
